# React / Next.js Conventions

## Components

- Functional components only; colocate in `src/components/`
- Sections: `src/components/sections/` (Hero, Services, etc.)
- Layout: `src/components/layout/` (Header, Footer, WhatsAppButton)

## Section wrapper

```tsx
<section className="py-16 md:py-24">
  <div className="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">{children}</div>
</section>
```

## Images

Use `next/image` with meaningful `alt`. Remote: Facebook CDN allowed in next.config.

## Links

External links: `target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"`. Phone: `tel:+919322887442`.

## Metadata

Export `metadata` or `generateMetadata` per route. Titles: "Page | 9X Wealth".

## Animations

Framer Motion sparingly — fade/slide on scroll, no distracting loops.
